<BaseLayout
  title="Winter in Central Portugal: what December, January and February are really like near Pombal"
  description="December–February near Pombal: 14–16 °C afternoons, 4–6 °C nights, 105–127 mm of rain a month, empty monuments, Óbidos Vila Natal and the lowest prices of the year."
